# Agent memory: CLAUDE.md is the single source of truth (see its section 14).
# AGENTS.md was a stale byte-drifted copy; do not recreate it.
AGENTS.md
MUJOCO_LOG.TXT

# Recorded demonstrations and the episode ledger: data, not source. Back these up
# off-machine (PLAN.md Phase 6) - they are irreplaceable human-generated episodes.
recordings/

# Training run directories: metrics, checkpoints and metadata. Artifacts of a
# run, not source. Each run's metadata.json records its own data provenance.
runs/

# Cloned upstream references (e.g. tonyzhaozh/act). Read-only, never vendored
# into the tracked tree; the commit hash in NOTES.md is what makes them citable.
reference/
*.pt
!unitree_rl_gym/deploy/pre_train/**/*.pt
